---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="What the Kassova website collects, where it goes and what it does not do.">
  <section class="hero shell prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>What this site collects, and what it does not.</h1>
    <h2>No tracking</h2>
    <p>This site sets no cookies and loads nothing from another company: no analytics, no tag manager, no web fonts, no embedded video and no CAPTCHA. The pages contain no scripts that run in your browser.</p>
    <h2>What a form sends</h2>
    <p>When you send a form, we receive what you typed (name, work email, and anything optional you added), which form you used, the page you sent it from and the campaign that page belongs to. We use it only to answer your request.</p>
    <h2>Where it goes</h2>
    <p>The form is received by an Azure Logic App in our own Microsoft cloud tenant and stored as a lead in our Microsoft Dynamics 365 environment. It is not passed to any other company, sold or added to a mailing list.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask us to show, correct or delete what we hold about you. Use <a href="/contact/">talk to us</a> and say what you would like; a person will act on it.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
